The counter starts at 0. What does the button show after one click?

```jsx
function Counter() {
  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);
  return (
    <button onClick={() => {
      setCount(count + 1);
      setCount(count + 1);
      setCount(count + 1);
    }}>
      {count}
    </button>
  );
}
```

