In development, what does React do with this code?

```jsx
function Child({ onSeen }) {
  onSeen();
  return <i>child</i>;
}

function Parent() {
  const [seen, setSeen] = useState(false);
  return <Child onSeen={() => setSeen(true)} />;
}
```

